{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"83029","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/83029","key":"MC-267006","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"25/Nov/23 4:08 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>When a player(survival mode) is standing in an Ender Dragon's hitbox, the Distance Flown statistic will rapidly increase.</p>\n\n<p>In the attached video, The Distance Flown increased about 80km within less than a minute.</p>\n\n<p>This is not a duplicate of \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro\" data-jira-key=\"MC-30542\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-30542\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"&quot;minecraft.custom:minecraft.fly_one_cm&quot; increases when moving through the air despite not actually flying\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-30542\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Reopened</span>\n            </span>\n because in this case players actually don't move.</p>\n\n<p><b>Steps to reproduce</b></p>\n\n<p>1.run /data merge entity @e<span class=\"error\">[type=ender_dragon,limit=1]</span> {DragonPhase:3} to make the dragon land.</p>\n\n<p>2.When the dragon land, stand at the center of the dragon and switch to survival mode.</p>\n\n<p>3.Open the statistics and note down the distance flown.</p>\n\n<p>4.Waiting until the dragon knockback you, open the statistics and note down the distance flown again.</p>\n\n<p><b>Observed behaviour:</b></p>\n\n<p>The distance flown increased over 50 km.</p>\n\n<p><b>Expected behaviour:</b></p>\n\n<p>The distance flown don't increase.</p>\n\n<p><b>Notes:</b></p>\n\n<p>This bug happened since 1.9.</p>\n\n<p>I think it's because the dragon always gives player a large amount of server velocity when they are in the Dragon's knockback hitbox even if the player don't actually move.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"25/Nov/23 12:45 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/107401","id":"107401","filename":"image-2024-05-28-12-50-45-086.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"COMETC2021A1","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Shanghai","accountType":"customer"},"created":"27/May/24 9:50 PM","size":"1014 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/107401","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/107401"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/107402","id":"107402","filename":"Not move but flown 80km.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"COMETC2021A1","active":tru